# Customer Success Story: MediCare Health Systems

## Challenge
MediCare Health Systems needed to consolidate patient data from 15 different systems to improve care coordination and operational efficiency.

## Solution
Implemented NexaInsight Platform with healthcare-specific templates and HIPAA-compliant data governance.

## Results
- 35% improvement in care coordination
- 20% reduction in duplicate tests
- $8M in annual cost savings

